{
  "Pregnancy.Amily.AHermaphrodite": "a hermaphrodite"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.AnotherWoman": "another woman"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.CampFirst": "she's probably just glad you're the one that has to push them all out"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.CampPart1": "You wake up suddenly to strong pains and pressures in your gut. As your eyes shoot wide open, you look down to see your belly absurdly full and distended. You can feel movement underneath the skin, and watch as it is pushed out in many places, roiling and squirming in disturbing ways. The feelings you get from inside are just as disconcerting. You count not one, but many little things moving around inside you. There are so many, you can't keep track of them.[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.CampPart2": "Pain shoots through you as they pull open your cervix forcefully, causing you to cry out involuntarily. At once, Amily suddenly appears, racing over from across the camp. [say: Is it time? Are you going into labor?] she asks, worry evident in her voice.[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.CampPart3": "You grunt in affirmation with a trace of irritation; {0}. However, any more detailed reply you may have been inclined to make to that is swallowed by another cry of pain as yet another contraction wrings its way through you. Amily takes your hand in hers and you cling to the lifeline of comfort it offers, thankful to not be alone for this. You can feel the first child moving out of your womb, through your cervix, down and into your [vagina]. Your lips part and, with a grunt, you expel the first child into Amily's waiting hand. She holds it up to you so that you can see your firstborn; it's a little mouselet. Amily helps hold it to your [chest], where it eagerly takes hold of your [nipple] and starts to suckle. As it drinks, it starts to grow larger. It quickly drinks its fill and then detaches, its 'father' putting it aside, which is good, because by this time there's another baby waiting for its turn... and another... and another...[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.CampPart4": "Soon, you are back to your old self again, lying down in exhaustion with Amily sitting nearby, your many rambunctious offspring already starting to walk and play around you. However, you notice that they are a little less large and energetic than the other times you have seen them born and grow in such a fashion.[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.CampPart5": "[say: Because there are only trace elements of those chemicals left in our bodies, they should age normally from this point on.] Amily notes.[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.CampPart6": "Worry fills you; how on earth are you going to take care of such small, defenseless creatures in a place like this? Before you can voice such concerns to Amily, though, rustling in the bushes catches your attention. As you watch, a pair of young mouse fellows appear and walk confidently into your camp. They're two of your children, the ones who Amily told you had left the area.[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.CampPart7": "[say: I hope you don't mind, [name], but I contacted them to come and take their new siblings back with them shortly after you told me you were pregnant.] Amily says, sheepishly. [say: We just can't really care for them here, and they'll be safer and happier with all their siblings.][pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.CampPart8": "You nod your head and admit that you agree. Once you have regained your strength, you spend some time talking with your fully adult children and playing with your overdeveloped newborns. Then, with a final wave goodbye, the family of mice disappear into the wilderness once more."
  "Pregnancy.Amily.CampPart9": "[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.CampRepeat": "this is hardly the first time you've given birth to her offspring before, after all"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.EndAccept1": "You stare at her in surprise. Then, you take hold of her hands and smile at her. You tell her that nothing would make you happier than to have her here, living with you, being with her. Amily squeaks loudly with joy and passionately embraces you, kissing you as deeply as she can. When she finally lets you go for lack of air, she takes a good long look around the camp, as if she's seeing it for the first time.[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.EndAccept2": "[say: Well, I better start moving in, huh?] she jokes. She then flops down on your sleeping roll beside you, [say: There we are, I'm moved in.] She grins at you, and you can't help but laugh.[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.EndAsk": "Do you accept her offer?"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.EndConfession": "[say: You know that this... well, this isn't how I saw my future going. I wanted a human mate to help me make pure children, to revive my race, that's true, but... I kind of always saw myself as the mother to those children. But, being the father... well, it's not so bad.] She takes your hands in hers, looking deep into your eyes. [saystart]I... I never dreamed I'd say this to {0}, but... I love you. The children, they're going to leave here now, and set up a new village somewhere else. But I... I want to stay here with you. Forever. Please, say yes.[sayend][pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.EndFriends1": "You think about it, and then shake your head. You tell her that you do appreciate her feelings, but you're not sure the two of you are ready to make the commitment that living together entails. Besides, your camp is set up to guard the portal leading back to your world; that makes it a magnet for demons. You can't imagine exposing her to the danger that moving to camp would entail for her.[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.EndFriends2": "Amily doesn't look entirely happy, but you assure her that you will keep coming back to see her. And when you tease at the possibility of a few more litters in your respective futures, stroking her penis through her tattered pants, she blushes but agrees to go.[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.EndIntro": "When you awake, the children are gone, and Amily has prepared something for you to eat. You eagerly start to feed yourself as Amily, looking grave, begins to speak.[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.EndShootDown1": "You stare at her coldly, and inform her that you have no interest in any kind of relationship with her on that level. You decided to let her plant her brats in you out of pity, but now that she no longer needs your womb, you have no more intention of renting it out to her.[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.EndShootDown2": "Amily reels, heartstruck, her expression making it clear that her heart has shattered, tears rolling down her face. [say: I... I didn't know that was the way you felt about me. F-Fine, if that's how it is...] She bursts into sobs and runs away; you know she'll never come back.[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.HugelyPregnant": "<b>You feel (and look) hugely pregnant, now, but you feel content. You know the, ah, 'father' of these children loves you, and they will love you in turn.</b>[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.KickingFrequently": "<b>The children kick and squirm frequently. Your bladder, stomach and lungs all feel very squished. You're glad that they'll be coming out of you soon.</b>[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.MoreThanOne": "<b>You jolt from the sensation of squirming inside your swollen stomach. Fortunately, it dies down quickly, but you know for a fact that you felt more than one baby kicking inside you.</b>[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.NormalPart1": "You wake up suddenly to strong pains and pressures in your gut. As your eyes shoot wide open, you look down to see your belly absurdly full and distended. You can feel movement underneath the skin, and watch as it is pushed out in many places, roiling and squirming in disturbing ways. The feelings you get from inside are just as disconcerting. You count not one, but many little things moving around inside you. There are so many, you can't keep track of them.[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.NormalPart2": "Pain shoots through you as they pull open your cervix forcefully, causing you to cry out involuntarily. At once, Amily suddenly appears, racing out from the undergrowth. [say: Is it time? Are you going into labor?] she asks, worry evident in her voice. Your pain is momentarily forgotten by your surprise and you ask where she came from. She snorts disdainfully at the question. [say: I've been shadowing you for a couple of days, now. Did you really think I'd let the mother of my children go through this alone?][pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.NormalPart3": "Any reply you may have been inclined to make to that is swallowed by another cry of pain as yet another contraction wrings its way through you. Amily takes your hand in hers and you cling to the lifeline of comfort it offers, thankful to not be alone for this. You can feel the first child moving out of your womb, through your cervix, down and into your [vagina]. Your lips part and, with a grunt, you expel the first child into Amily's waiting hand. She holds it up to you so that you can see your firstborn; it's a little mouselet. Amily helps hold it to your [chest], where it eagerly takes hold of your [nipple] and starts to suckle. As it drinks, it starts to grow larger. It quickly drinks its fill and then detaches, its 'father' putting it aside, which is good, because by this time there's another baby waiting for its turn... and another... and another...[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.NormalPart4": "Soon, you are back to your old self again, lying down in exhaustion with Amily sitting nearby, your many rambunctious offspring already starting to walk and play around you.[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.NormalPart5": "[say: Look at them all. You... I never thought it would turn out this way, but you're helping my dream to come true. Thank you,] Amily tells you sincerely. You're too exhausted to keep your eyes open for long, but she promises to stay in touch and, even as you fall asleep, she's gathering up your children and taking them away."
  "Pregnancy.Amily.NormalPart6": ""
  "Pregnancy.Amily.QuestPart1": "You wake up suddenly to strong pains and pressures in your gut. As your eyes shoot wide open, you look down to see your belly absurdly full and distended. You can feel movement underneath the skin, and watch as it is pushed out in many places, roiling and squirming in disturbing ways. The feelings you get from inside are just as disconcerting. You count not one, but many little things moving around inside you. There are so many, you can't keep track of them.[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.QuestPart2": "Pain shoots through you as they pull open your cervix forcefully, causing you to cry out involuntarily. At once, Amily suddenly appears, racing out from the undergrowth. [say: Is it time? Are you going into labor?] she asks, worry evident in her voice. Your pain is momentarily forgotten by your surprise and you ask where she came from. She snorts disdainfully at the question. [say: I've been shadowing you for a couple of days, now. Did you really think I'd let the mother of my children go through this alone?][pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.QuestPart3": "Any reply you may have been inclined to make to that is swallowed by another cry of pain as yet another contraction wrings its way through you. Amily takes your hand in hers and you cling to the lifeline of comfort it offers, thankful to not be alone for this. You can feel the first child moving out of your womb, through your cervix, down and into your [vagina]. Your lips part and, with a grunt, you expel the first child into Amily's waiting hand. She holds it up to you so that you can see your firstborn; it's a little mouselet. Amily helps hold it to your [breasts], where it eagerly takes hold of your [nipple] and starts to suckle. As it drinks, it starts to grow larger. It quickly drinks its fill and then detaches, its 'father' putting it aside, which is good, because by this time there's another baby waiting for its turn... and another... and another...[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.QuestPart4": "Soon, you are back to your old self again, lying down in exhaustion with Amily sitting nearby, your many rambunctious offspring already starting to walk and play around you.[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.QuestPart5": "[say: Get some rest, darling. There are things you and I need to talk about,] Amily instructs you.[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.QuestPart6": "You are eager to comply, though your last thought as you sink into unconsciousness is to wonder what Amily wants to talk about."
  "Pregnancy.Amily.ReassuringSmile": "Amily smiles at you reassuringly. [say: We do have litters, dear, this is normal.][pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Amily.Unmistakable": "[b:There is no question you're pregnant; your belly is already as big as that of any pregnant woman back home.][pg]"
}
